WEBVTT

1
00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:32.083
In verse 14.18,

2
00:00:32.083 --> 00:00:34.000
Lord Krishna explains that

3
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:35.833
when a person acts under the influence

4
00:00:35.833 --> 00:00:36.833
of the three gunas –

5
00:00:36.833 --> 00:00:39.541
sattva, rajas, and tamas –

6
00:00:39.541 --> 00:00:41.208
their next destination

7
00:00:41.208 --> 00:00:43.875
is determined accordingly.

8
00:00:48.583 --> 00:00:49.833
Now listen,

9
00:00:49.833 --> 00:00:52.250
A person who lives in sattva Guna

10
00:00:52.250 --> 00:00:56.208
develops divine tendencies such as knowledge,

11
00:00:56.208 --> 00:00:59.291
compassion, and discipline.

12
00:00:59.291 --> 00:01:00.000
These very qualities

13
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:03.083
make their consciousness urdhvagami –

14
00:01:03.083 --> 00:01:06.000
that is : upward-moving.

15
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:06.875
At the time of death,

16
00:01:06.875 --> 00:01:10.375
such souls rise toward higher realms,

17
00:01:10.375 --> 00:01:12.083
where they experience joy

18
00:01:12.083 --> 00:01:14.541
and purity.

19
00:01:14.541 --> 00:01:17.291
These higher realms, such as Brahmaloka,

20
00:01:17.291 --> 00:01:21.416
provide an environment largely
free from suffering.

21
00:01:21.416 --> 00:01:22.625
On the other hand,

22
00:01:22.625 --> 00:01:25.375
when life is driven by Rajo Guna,

23
00:01:25.375 --> 00:01:28.708
the mind remains constantly entangled
in desires, ambitions,

24
00:01:28.708 --> 00:01:31.333
and restlessness.

25
00:01:31.333 --> 00:01:34.125
Motivated by self-interest and attachment
to results,

26
00:01:34.125 --> 00:01:37.750
such people are reborn on this very earth

27
00:01:37.750 --> 00:01:38.833
and remain bound in the endless cycle

28
00:01:38.833 --> 00:01:42.708
of karma and consequence.

29
00:01:42.708 --> 00:01:45.708
And when someone is trapped in Tamo Guna,

30
00:01:45.708 --> 00:01:47.583
their life becomes surrounded by laziness,

31
00:01:47.583 --> 00:01:51.458
confusion, and destructive tendencies.

32
00:01:51.458 --> 00:01:54.583
Such souls descend into lower states –

33
00:01:54.583 --> 00:01:55.541
animal,

34
00:01:55.541 --> 00:01:56.750
plant,

35
00:01:56.750 --> 00:01:57.833
or even hellish

36
00:01:57.833 --> 00:02:00.041
species –

37
00:02:00.041 --> 00:02:04.958
where they must experience the fruits
of their ignorance.

38
00:02:04.958 --> 00:02:07.500
Lord Krishna explains here –

39
00:02:07.500 --> 00:02:11.625
if the soul remains constantly
submerged in ignorance,

40
00:02:11.625 --> 00:02:16.125
this rare human birth is wasted.

41
00:02:16.125 --> 00:02:18.875
But the one who cultivates sattva

42
00:02:18.875 --> 00:02:21.250
and walks the path of devotion

43
00:02:21.250 --> 00:02:24.541
rises above all three gunas,

44
00:02:24.541 --> 00:02:27.500
is freed from the bondage of birth and death,

45
00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:29.875
and reaches the supreme destination.

46
00:02:34.583 --> 00:02:37.458
Sometimes you may feel

47
00:02:37.458 --> 00:02:41.000
that life has come to a standstill,

48
00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:44.041
that you are not moving forward at all.

49
00:02:44.041 --> 00:02:47.458
But let Me remind you –

50
00:02:47.458 --> 00:02:52.541
you never truly stand still.

51
00:02:52.541 --> 00:02:55.041
You are exactly where

52
00:02:55.041 --> 00:02:58.708
your dominant guna has brought you.

53
00:02:58.708 --> 00:03:02.875
When Tamo Guna takes over,

54
00:03:02.875 --> 00:03:05.583
laziness, procrastination,

55
00:03:05.583 --> 00:03:08.541
and doubt increase.

56
00:03:08.541 --> 00:03:11.375
Without even making an effort,

57
00:03:11.375 --> 00:03:13.833
the mind gives up.

58
00:03:13.833 --> 00:03:16.375
When Rajo Guna is active,

59
00:03:16.375 --> 00:03:19.291
you keep running constantly –

60
00:03:19.291 --> 00:03:25.000
chasing goals, achievements, recognition.

61
00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:27.541
But peace is not found within.

62
00:03:27.541 --> 00:03:32.083
There is tiredness, but no contentment.

63
00:03:32.083 --> 00:03:35.000
And when sattva Guna grows,

64
00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:38.083
I see this –

65
00:03:38.083 --> 00:03:43.625
you become calm, clear, and steady.

66
00:03:43.625 --> 00:03:46.791
Your decisions are thoughtful.

67
00:03:46.791 --> 00:03:51.625
You move from understanding, not impulse.

68
00:03:51.625 --> 00:03:55.000
You choose peace, not instability.

69
00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:57.500
Now ask yourself –

70
00:03:57.500 --> 00:04:02.375
which guna is driving your day today?

71
00:04:02.375 --> 00:04:08.125
Because your guna determines your direction.

72
00:04:08.125 --> 00:04:11.791
If you wish to change your life,

73
00:04:11.791 --> 00:04:14.208
you do not need to fight

74
00:04:14.208 --> 00:04:15.875
the world.

75
00:04:15.875 --> 00:04:20.750
You only need to rise in your guna.

76
00:04:20.750 --> 00:04:24.791
Think about this – a friend

77
00:04:24.791 --> 00:04:26.333
is inviting you to meet

78
00:04:26.333 --> 00:04:29.208
a famous person.

79
00:04:29.208 --> 00:04:30.541
At the same time,

80
00:04:30.541 --> 00:04:33.208
your father needs to go to the doctor

81
00:04:33.208 --> 00:04:37.333
and your child has a school event.

82
00:04:37.333 --> 00:04:39.750
What will you choose?

83
00:04:39.750 --> 00:04:43.791
Sattva – where you fulfil your duty?

84
00:04:43.791 --> 00:04:45.541
Or rajas –

85
00:04:45.541 --> 00:04:47.666
where you get a photograph

86
00:04:47.666 --> 00:04:51.000
with a renowned person just for show?

87
00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:53.333
Nourish sattva –

88
00:04:53.333 --> 00:04:56.416
through sattvic food, good company,

89
00:04:56.416 --> 00:04:59.666
and spiritual practice.

90
00:04:59.666 --> 00:05:05.041
This is the path by which you not
only move forward,

91
00:05:05.041 --> 00:05:06.750
but become urdhvagami – Toward Me.

92
00:05:11.541 --> 00:05:15.500
Every home has its own culture –

93
00:05:15.500 --> 00:05:18.500
and it quietly determines

94
00:05:18.500 --> 00:05:22.666
in which direction the family will move.

95
00:05:22.666 --> 00:05:26.291
When the home is filled with sattva Guna –

96
00:05:26.291 --> 00:05:29.875
good habits, respectful speech,

97
00:05:29.875 --> 00:05:33.041
sattvic food, and prayer –

98
00:05:33.041 --> 00:05:34.958
I see you all

99
00:05:34.958 --> 00:05:39.333
rising together,

100
00:05:39.333 --> 00:05:42.291
moving in the upward direction

101
00:05:42.291 --> 00:05:45.791
of life.

102
00:05:45.791 --> 00:05:48.875
There is peace and clarity there,

103
00:05:48.875 --> 00:05:53.125
and a deep connection – not only

104
00:05:53.125 --> 00:05:56.708
with each other, but with Me too.

105
00:05:56.708 --> 00:05:58.291
If

106
00:05:58.291 --> 00:06:01.666
Rajo Guna dominates at home,

107
00:06:01.666 --> 00:06:05.833
energy is there – but so is noise,

108
00:06:05.833 --> 00:06:09.000
restlessness, comparison,

109
00:06:09.000 --> 00:06:12.541
and the constant pressure of doing.

110
00:06:12.541 --> 00:06:15.083
There is movement, but it feels

111
00:06:15.083 --> 00:06:19.083
like going in circles –

112
00:06:19.083 --> 00:06:22.125
tiredness without contentment.

113
00:06:22.125 --> 00:06:26.791
And when Tamo Guna spreads in the home –

114
00:06:26.791 --> 00:06:28.791
through neglect, harsh words,

115
00:06:28.791 --> 00:06:32.291
or thoughtless indulgence –

116
00:06:32.291 --> 00:06:36.250
the family begins to slide downward.

117
00:06:36.250 --> 00:06:39.916
The enthusiasm for purpose dims.

118
00:06:39.916 --> 00:06:45.000
Now ask yourself – what kind of atmosphere

119
00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:48.416
are you all creating together?

120
00:06:48.416 --> 00:06:51.666
Remember – your shared direction

121
00:06:51.666 --> 00:06:55.916
is shaped by your small daily choices.

122
00:06:55.916 --> 00:07:00.000
Even if just one member

123
00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:03.083
moves toward sattva Guna,

124
00:07:03.083 --> 00:07:07.958
they can lift the entire family upward.

125
00:07:07.958 --> 00:07:12.000
Be that first change –

126
00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:13.583
I am with you.

127
00:07:18.500 --> 00:07:20.333
In every organisation,

128
00:07:20.333 --> 00:07:24.333
A stream of activity flows -

129
00:07:24.333 --> 00:07:27.416
it takes its shape from the gunas

130
00:07:27.416 --> 00:07:30.750
and carries everyone along with it.

131
00:07:30.750 --> 00:07:36.125
When sattva Guna is predominant,

132
00:07:36.125 --> 00:07:38.791
conversations are clear,

133
00:07:38.791 --> 00:07:41.208
work is done with integrity,

134
00:07:41.208 --> 00:07:44.208
and there is space for thoughtful reflection.

135
00:07:44.208 --> 00:07:47.166
The workplace becomes a foundation not only

136
00:07:47.166 --> 00:07:52.208
for developing skill, but character.

137
00:07:52.208 --> 00:07:56.375
People grow together. But

138
00:07:56.375 --> 00:08:00.125
when Rajo Guna takes over, everything revolves

139
00:08:00.125 --> 00:08:01.708
around speed, targets,

140
00:08:01.708 --> 00:08:04.000
and comparison.

141
00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:05.458
Ambition is there –

142
00:08:05.458 --> 00:08:07.000
but so is exhaustion.

143
00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:08.083
Everyone is running,

144
00:08:08.083 --> 00:08:12.416
but no one finds peace.

145
00:08:12.416 --> 00:08:14.625
And -

146
00:08:14.625 --> 00:08:17.625
How will growth occur?

147
00:08:17.625 --> 00:08:20.958
such growth eventually becomes entanglement.

148
00:08:20.958 --> 00:08:24.666
And when Tamo Guna enters within,

149
00:08:24.666 --> 00:08:25.750
even bright

150
00:08:25.750 --> 00:08:29.166
minds become dim.

151
00:08:29.166 --> 00:08:32.041
Indifference, gossip,

152
00:08:32.041 --> 00:08:34.416
and resistance to change –

153
00:08:34.416 --> 00:08:38.333
these slowly pull the culture downward.

154
00:08:38.333 --> 00:08:39.375
At the workplace

155
00:08:39.375 --> 00:08:42.583
you will meet people of different natures.

156
00:08:42.583 --> 00:08:44.750
Someone may slack

157
00:08:44.750 --> 00:08:46.416
and escape the supervisor’s notice

158
00:08:46.416 --> 00:08:48.583
through deceit.

159
00:08:48.583 --> 00:08:52.458
But do not become like them.

160
00:08:52.458 --> 00:08:55.583
Through your own sattvic conduct,

161
00:08:55.583 --> 00:08:58.708
inspire even that weak person

162
00:08:58.708 --> 00:09:00.000
toward integrity.

163
00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:02.958
Then not only will you find joy,

164
00:09:02.958 --> 00:09:07.083
but the entire workplace will rise too.

165
00:09:07.083 --> 00:09:12.666
So pause for a moment and look around you.

166
00:09:12.666 --> 00:09:15.916
Who is being recognised here?

167
00:09:15.916 --> 00:09:19.291
Who is being overlooked?

168
00:09:19.291 --> 00:09:23.000
And what are you adding to this current?

169
00:09:23.000 --> 00:09:25.958
Remember – even one person

170
00:09:25.958 --> 00:09:29.208
who nourishes sattva

171
00:09:29.208 --> 00:09:35.375
can change the direction of the entire current.

172
00:09:35.375 --> 00:09:39.291
That person can be you.

173
00:09:39.291 --> 00:09:42.208
And when you do this,

174
00:09:42.208 --> 00:09:46.375
I will be with you.
